{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "72486791-736c-86cb-bd82-35c102c84723",
  "created_at": "2025-12-19T15:16:14-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Joao Cabral",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T15:12:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T15:12:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, hello. Can you hear me okay? I'm on speaker, my hands are kind of full."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T15:12:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T15:12:55-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, um, my trash didn't get picked up. Again. It's the second time in a row they missed us. I put the barrel out Thursday morning, and it was still sitting there full when I got home."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T15:13:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry about that. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T15:13:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "6 Narragansett Avenue. Fifth Ward, over by the, um, wait, what was I saying. Sorry. Yeah, 6 Narragansett."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T15:13:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 6 Narragansett Avenue. And you said you put it out Thursday. Was that after the rain yesterday, or before it started?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T15:13:32-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It was the day after the rain started, I think. The rain was Wednesday into Thursday, right? So yeah, Thursday morning it was still coming down a little. Maybe they skipped because of the weather? I don't know. [pause] Oh, and there's something else, kind of related."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T15:13:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T15:13:53-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Somebody, a neighbor I think, keeps dumping bags of trash at the corner. Like, right at the corner by my building. Four or five black bags just stacked there. I don't think the crew takes them because they're not in a barrel, so they sit there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T15:14:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So loose bags at the corner near your place, not on your own pickup spot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T15:14:18-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. Not mine. Mine's the barrel. The bags are on the corner, and I don't want to say who, because I'm not totally sure who. I just want it cleaned up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T15:14:31-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put in a request for the missed pickup at your address and a separate one for the bags at that corner so a supervisor can look at it. Is it your landlord who handles the trash at the building, or is it you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T15:14:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's me, I'm the renter, but it's the city pickup. The barrel's the city one, I think. Ha, I honestly don't know. Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T15:14:59-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I'll note it as a resident barrel. Can I get a number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T15:15:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0168."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T15:15:10-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0168. Got it. Leave the barrel where it is, don't pull it back in, and they should come by on their next run. I'd say give it until Saturday or Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T15:15:23-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Cool. It's so dark already, huh? I got home and it was basically night. It's barely after three now and it's going to be dark in an hour."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T15:15:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I know, it's the shortest days of the year right now. By the time I leave here it's pitch black."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T15:15:44-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, so I couldn't even see how full the corner was last night. I just walked past with my phone flashlight. Ha. Anyway, what was I asking? Oh, so the barrel stays out. Right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T15:15:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, leave it out. Both requests are in, the missed pickup and the bags at the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T15:16:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Thank you. Appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T15:16:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good weekend, Joao."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T15:16:12-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
